// Monitor layout for stormlight.
//
// Arrange displays graphically with `nwg-displays` (bound to Mod+Shift+M):
// drag the outputs around, set mode/scale/rotation, then hit Apply. It
// overwrites this file and niri reloads it immediately.
//
// Hand-editing works just as well. Run `niri msg outputs` for connector
// names and the modes each one supports:
//
//   output "DP-1" {
//       mode "2560x1440@143.912"
//       scale 1.0
//       position x=0 y=0
//       variable-refresh-rate
//   }
//
//   output "HDMI-A-1" {
//       mode "1920x1080@60.000"
//       scale 1.0
//       // positions are in logical (post-scale) pixels
//       position x=2560 y=0
//   }
//
// `off` disables an output, `transform "90"` rotates it, and an output with
// no position set is placed automatically.
//
// For a throwaway tweak that should not be saved, use
// `niri msg output <name> position set <x> <y>` instead.
//
// Docs: https://yalter.github.io/niri/Configuration:-Outputs
